\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Happy on 2026-11-09. Due to differences in photo parameters, notably color balance or other processing, comparison to the 2020 image may be difficult but she is becoming more white on ventral side mostly. }}{4}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:happy2026}{{2}{4}{Happy on 2026-11-09. Due to differences in photo parameters, notably color balance or other processing, comparison to the 2020 image may be difficult but she is becoming more white on ventral side mostly}{figure.2}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Happy's weight ( blue ) at various times. Claire\'s weight i ( red ) is shown for comparison generally measured on the same day. A household scale was used with significant tare weight possibly leading to fluctuations that were reduced later by allowing the scale to "warm up." Claire is of similar size as Happy but generally healthy although maybe a little heavier than she should be. They had diet adjustments and exercise that nominally tracked each other although sometimes ajustments were made separately to control weight. }}{4}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:happyweight}{{3}{4}{Happy's weight ( blue ) at various times. Claire\'s weight i ( red ) is shown for comparison generally measured on the same day. A household scale was used with significant tare weight possibly leading to fluctuations that were reduced later by allowing the scale to "warm up." Claire is of similar size as Happy but generally healthy although maybe a little heavier than she should be. They had diet adjustments and exercise that nominally tracked each other although sometimes ajustments were made separately to control weight}{figure.3}{}}
